6. One important consideration: Is it production-ready?
You need to distinguish between running a local model and operating an AI service for hundreds of users.
Scenario	Suitability
Personal AI assistant	Excellent
Development and testing	Excellent
Internal company assistant	Good
DevOps incident analysis	Good
Hundreds of concurrent users	Requires proper GPU infrastructure and scaling
Mission-critical AI service	Requires reliability, monitoring, security and fallback mechanisms

Also, Docker Model Runner's API is not authenticated by default. Don't expose it directly to the public internet

